\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Optimal parental investment decisions under non-linear returns to human capital. The figure illustrates the coexistence of two global optima, one in the low-return regime and another exceeding the threshold $\bar  I$ under convex indifference curves. This result complements Figure 1(b) in \blx@tocontentsinit {0}\textcite {Bratsberg_2007} by endogenizing the conjecture of a convex relationship in intergenerational income transmission through discrete changes in returns to human capital investment.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
